# HY300 Pro -- the board of issue #1 (owner GitHub fightforlife, 13.09.2026). No image of its firmware
# here; everything comes from what its owner posted. Not the HY200 QZ713DF A1 (README.md). Below
# "verified": TEST images for its owner only, never a release image (boards/README.md).
BOARD_ID=hy300-pro
STATUS=partial
VERIFIED_BY=
PROFILE=hy300_pro
IMAGE_NAME=h713-hy300-pro
# patch 0161, since 0181 sun50i-h713-hy310.dts included under this board's own name; plus the lamp's
# PWM words (0166a), no pwm-backlight, its elog addresses, its own focus motor tables (0182)
KERNEL_DTB=sun50i-h713-hy300-pro
UBOOT_BOARD=hy300_pro
# FEATURES (boards/README.md) deliberately unset: nothing was seen working on his unit under our firmware.
# accelerometer: a chip answers at 0x18 (his stock log, stk83xx driver), ours drives an SC7A20 there;
# focus-motor: enabled in his stock tree, never seen moving under ours; camera: no sign of one.
